    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709540/extras/0ccc6e48778b6ba6af6d64efc3ed6e42.poster.avif?t=1749481785\" width=480 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709540/extras/0ccc6e48778b6ba6af6d64efc3ed6e42.webm?t=1749481785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709540/extras/0ccc6e48778b6ba6af6d64efc3ed6e42.mp4?t=1749481785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Lost Harmony is a cozy solar-punk game, where you embody a bird soaring through the skies. It's your opportunity to take some time off and just relax in a cozy world without any distractions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709540/extras/4749b62583f7d8ad593a9effc83c0383.poster.avif?t=1749481785\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709540/extras/4749b62583f7d8ad593a9effc83c0383.webm?t=1749481785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709540/extras/4749b62583f7d8ad593a9effc83c0383.mp4?t=1749481785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore a beautiful world that's opened to you right from the start. You decide what you want to do.<br>Play with charming animals? Help them? Or just sit down and relax together. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709540/extras/96542c6dcfbb4b1448eac5742a54fc91.poster.avif?t=1749481785\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709540/extras/96542c6dcfbb4b1448eac5742a54fc91.webm?t=1749481785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709540/extras/96542c6dcfbb4b1448eac5742a54fc91.mp4?t=1749481785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore solarpunk open world<br></li><li> Solve puzzles to unlock new areas<br></li><li> Interact with cute animals<br></li><li> Learn about where humans disappeared to</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709540/extras/0ccc6e48778b6ba6af6d64efc3ed6e42.poster.avif?t=1749481785\" width=480 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709540/extras/0ccc6e48778b6ba6af6d64efc3ed6e42.webm?t=1749481785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709540/extras/0ccc6e48778b6ba6af6d64efc3ed6e42.mp4?t=1749481785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Lost Harmony is a cozy solar-punk game, where you embody a bird soaring through the skies. It's your opportunity to take some time off and just relax in a cozy world without any distractions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709540/extras/4749b62583f7d8ad593a9effc83c0383.poster.avif?t=1749481785\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709540/extras/4749b62583f7d8ad593a9effc83c0383.webm?t=1749481785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709540/extras/4749b62583f7d8ad593a9effc83c0383.mp4?t=1749481785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore a beautiful world that's opened to you right from the start. You decide what you want to do.<br>Play with charming animals? Help them? Or just sit down and relax together. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709540/extras/96542c6dcfbb4b1448eac5742a54fc91.poster.avif?t=1749481785\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709540/extras/96542c6dcfbb4b1448eac5742a54fc91.webm?t=1749481785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709540/extras/96542c6dcfbb4b1448eac5742a54fc91.mp4?t=1749481785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore solarpunk open world<br></li><li> Solve puzzles to unlock new areas<br></li><li> Interact with cute animals<br></li><li> Learn about where humans disappeared to</li></ul>",
